  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancednature\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_556321.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enhanced-nature\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enhanced-nature?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancednature\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/556321(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hmaD7Se\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/EnhancedNature/blob/main/src/main/resources/enhanced_nature_logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\"/><br>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 简介\n\n本模组为你的世界增添了全新的世界特性！\n\n-----\n\n### 特性：\n\n- 全新稀有的华丽树木\n- 砂岩矿脉\n- 沙子矿脉\n- 圆石矿脉\n- 黏土矿脉\n- 深板岩矿脉\n- 蠹虫石矿脉\n- 新增流沙\n- 支持通过数据包进行配置！\n\n-----\n\n树木生成系统基于 [Rex's Tree Pack](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/rexs-tree-pack)\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 展示\n\n![棕榈树](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.50.02.png?raw=true)\n\n![白桦树](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.52.23.png?raw=true)\n\n![深色橡树](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.53.40.png?raw=true)\n\n![枯树](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.54.15.png?raw=true)\n\n![橡树](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2023-09-07_19.55.08.png?raw=true)\n\n![流沙](https://i.imgur.com/qinjtei.png)\n\n![额外石头矿脉](https://i.imgur.com/22H38rA.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🗃️ 依赖项\n\n### 必需：\n- **Magma Core**\n  - 提供基础代码与功能，例如更新检查器 \n  - [CurseForge][cf_magmacore] | [Modrinth][mr_magmacore]\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 我的其他模组！\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"额外结构\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"基岩矿工\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"工具升级\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"全兼容性\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"自定义地牢战利品\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"高级工具\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e13